{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/drug-device-alerts/class-3-medicines-recall-aspire-pharma-limited-tropicamide-1-percent-eye-drops-solution-in-single-dose-containers-20-x-0-dot-5ml-el-26-a-slash-47","content_id":"89baedac-d48e-40ea-ad1e-a02c2de4c4b2","description":"Aspire Pharma Ltd is recalling specific batches of Tropicamide 1% Eye Drops, solution in single dose containers 0.5ml x 20, due to them being labelled with the incorrect expiry date. The correct expiry date for these batches should be 31/10/2026. ","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"file","content_id":"00e5312b-5768-488e-b213-02cb97b032b0","content_type":"application/pdf","created_at":"2026-11-04T15:44:46+00:00","id":"00e5312b-5768-488e-b213-02cb97b032b0","title":"Class 3 Medicines Recall: Aspire Pharma Limited, Tropicamide 1% Eye Drops, solution in single dose containers 20 x 0.5ml , EL(26)A/47","updated_at":"2026-11-04T15:44:46+00:00","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6aeb52ee72d4b308dbe5c307/Class_3_Medicines_Recall_Aspire_Pharma_Limited__Tropicamide_1__Eye_Drops__solution_in_single_dose_containers_20_x_0.5ml___EL_26_A47.pdf"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"dmrc-reference-number\">DMRC reference number</h2>\n\n<p>DMRC-41341621</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"marketing-authorisation-holder\">Marketing Authorisation Holder</h2>\n\n<p>Aspire Pharma Ltd</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"medicine-details\">Medicine Details</h2>\n\n<h3 id=\"tropicamide-1-eye-drops-solution-in-single-dose-containers-20-x-05ml\">Tropicamide 1% Eye Drops, solution in single dose containers 20 x 0.5ml</h3>\n\n<p>PL: 35533/0198</p>\n\n<p>Active ingredient: tropicamide</p>\n\n<p>SNOMED code: 45542111000001107</p>\n\n<p>GTIN: 5060209733661</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"affected-lot-batch-numbers\">Affected Lot Batch Numbers</h2>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Batch No.</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Expiry Date</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Pack Size</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">First Distributed</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>E941A</td>\n      <td>30/04/2027*</td>\n      <td>20</td>\n      <td>29/10/2025</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>E941B</td>\n      <td>30/04/2027*</td>\n      <td>20</td>\n      <td>04/02/2026</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>E941C</td>\n      <td>30/04/2027*</td>\n      <td>20</td>\n      <td>20/02/2026</td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<p>*Incorrect expiry date printed on packs</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"background\">Background</h2>\n\n<p>Aspire Pharma Ltd is recalling the above specific batches of Tropicamide 1% Eye Drops, solution in single dose containers 0.5ml x 20, due to them being labelled with the incorrect expiry date. The correct expiry date for these batches should be 31/10/2026.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"advice-for-healthcare-professionals\">Advice for Healthcare Professionals:</h2>\n\n<p>Stop supplying the above batches immediately. Quarantine all remaining stock of these batches and return it to your supplier using your supplier’s approved process.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"advice-for--patients\">Advice for  Patients:</h2>\n\n<p>No further action is required by patients. This recall is being undertaken as a precautionary measure at the Pharmacy and Wholesaler level.</p>\n\n<p>Patients in possession of these batches should continue to use the eye drops and contact their prescriber to obtain a replacement prescription. No reports of adverse incidents due to this defect have been received to date.</p>\n\n<p>Patients who experience adverse reactions or have any questions about their medication should seek medical attention. Any suspected adverse reactions should also be reported via the <a rel=\"external\" href=\"https://yellowcard.mhra.gov.uk/\">MHRA Yellow Card scheme</a>.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"additional-information\">Additional information:</h2>\n\n<p>For all medical information enquiries and information on this product, please email <a href=\"mailto:medinfo@aspirepharma.com\">medinfo@aspirepharma.com</a>, or telephone 01730 231148.</p>\n\n<p>For stock control enquiries please email <a href=\"mailto:customerservices@aspirepharma.com\">customerservices@aspirepharma.com</a>, or telephone 01730 231148.</p>\n\n<p>Recipients of this Medicines Recall should bring it to the attention of relevant contacts by copy of this notice. NHS regional teams are asked to forward this to community pharmacists and dispensing general practitioners for information.</p>\n\n<p>Yours faithfully</p>\n\n<div class=\"address\"><div class=\"adr org fn\"><p>\nDefective Medicines Report Centre<br><br>10 South Colonnade<br><br>Canary Wharf<br><br>London<br><br>E14 4PU\n</p></div></div>\n\n<p>Telephone +44 (0)20 3080 6574</p>\n\n<p><a href=\"mailto:DMRC@mhra.gov.uk\">DMRC@mhra.gov.uk</a></p>\n\n<h2 id=\"download-document\">Download document</h2>\n\n<p><span id=\"attachment_00e5312b-5768-488e-b213-02cb97b032b0\" class=\"attachment-inline\"><a href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6aeb52ee72d4b308dbe5c307/Class_3_Medicines_Recall_Aspire_Pharma_Limited__Tropicamide_1__Eye_Drops__solution_in_single_dose_containers_20_x_0.5ml___EL_26_A47.pdf\">Class 3 Medicines Recall: Aspire Pharma Limited, Tropicamide 1% Eye Drops, solution in single dose containers 20 x 0.5ml , EL(26)A/47</a></span></p>\n\n","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2026-11-05T11:00:55Z"}],"headers":[{"id":"dmrc-reference-number","level":2,"text":"DMRC reference number"},{"id":"marketing-authorisation-holder","level":2,"text":"Marketing Authorisation Holder"},{"headers":[{"id":"tropicamide-1-eye-drops-solution-in-single-dose-containers-20-x-05ml","level":3,"text":"Tropicamide 1% Eye Drops, solution in single dose containers 20 x 0.5ml"}],"id":"medicine-details","level":2,"text":"Medicine Details"},{"id":"affected-lot-batch-numbers","level":2,"text":"Affected Lot Batch Numbers"},{"id":"background","level":2,"text":"Background"},{"id":"advice-for-healthcare-professionals","level":2,"text":"Advice for Healthcare Professionals:"},{"id":"advice-for--patients","level":2,"text":"Advice for  Patients:"},{"id":"additional-information","level":2,"text":"Additional information:"},{"id":"download-document","level":2,"text":"Download document"}],"max_cache_time":10,"metadata":{"alert_type":"medicines-recall-notification","issued_date":"2026-11-05","medical_specialism":["dispensing-gp-practices","pharmacy"]},"temporary_update_type":false},"document_type":"medical_safety_alert","first_published_at":"2026-11-05T11:00:55+00:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/drug-device-alerts/class-3-medicines-recall-aspire-pharma-limited-tropicamide-1-percent-eye-drops-solution-in-single-dose-containers-20-x-0-dot-5ml-el-26-a-slash-47","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/drug-device-alerts/class-3-medicines-recall-aspire-pharma-limited-tropicamide-1-percent-eye-drops-solution-in-single-dose-containers-20-x-0-dot-5ml-el-26-a-slash-47","base_path":"/drug-device-alerts/class-3-medicines-recall-aspire-pharma-limited-tropicamide-1-percent-eye-drops-solution-in-single-dose-containers-20-x-0-dot-5ml-el-26-a-slash-47","content_id":"89baedac-d48e-40ea-ad1e-a02c2de4c4b2","document_type":"medical_safety_alert","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2026-11-05T11:00:55Z","schema_name":"specialist_document","title":"Class 3 Medicines Recall: Aspire Pharma Limited, Tropicamide 1% Eye Drops, solution in single dose containers 20 x 0.5ml , EL(26)A/47 ","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/drug-device-alerts/class-3-medicines-recall-aspire-pharma-limited-tropicamide-1-percent-eye-drops-solution-in-single-dose-containers-20-x-0-dot-5ml-el-26-a-slash-47","withdrawn":false}],"finder":[{"api_path":"/api/content/drug-device-alerts","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/drug-device-alerts","base_path":"/drug-device-alerts","content_id":"1e9c0ada-5f7e-43cc-a55f-cc32757edaa3","details":{"facets":[{"allowed_values":[{"label":"Field safety notice","value":"field-safety-notices"},{"label":"National patient safety